<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DST System cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DST System cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it cut its rating on DST System Inc to hold from buy, noting shares were nearing the target price.</p>
<p>-- DST shares were off 3/8 at 32-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal said it also reduced its earnings per share estimates to $1.10 from $1.15 and for 1998 to $1.25 from $1.30. It cited &quot;continuing startup headaches in Europe and narrower domestic profitability stemming from increased compensation costs.&quot;</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
